I'm surprised you didn't mention the strategic importance that doors play
in Moria.  In Moria, there are the terribly dangerous lice which don't
inflict significant damage but multiply very rapidly.  This makes it very
important to close doors behind yourself to prevent the lice from taking
over the entire dungeon level and preventing you from moving.

In Nethack 3.0 patchlevel 5, doors are useless for keeping monsters away
from you.  I advise removing them from the game.

